TraceBack Architectural Standards

Core Stack: Node.js 22+, TypeScript (Strict), Fastify, BullMQ, Redis.

Agent Orchestration: Use @cursor/sdk for the primary agent loop.

Design Pattern: Supervisor-Worker (Maestro-Surgeon-Verifier).

Invariants:

Every agent action must be traceable via Weights & Biases Weave.

No logic should run synchronously in the webhook handler; always enqueue via BullMQ.

Use Zod for all input validation (Webhooks, API, MCP Tooling).